			</div>
			<div class="col-lg-6">
				<p><strong>Settlers of Catan</strong> is a game that takes a lot of planning ahead</p>
				<p>To familarize yourself with the rules of <strong>Settlers of Catan!</strong>, 
				<br> watch the <strong>video tutorial</strong> and learn from the best!</p>
